[7.239035, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"reward\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"Kiln is a single-GPU LLM inference server with live LoRA tra\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"reward\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"Kiln is a pure-Rust inference and online-training stack for \"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"reward\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m-1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"Kiln is a tool for managing kiln operations in pottery and c\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"reward\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m-1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[34;1m\"text\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"Kiln helps you fire pottery at the correct temperature sched\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
